        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Private Militaries in a Futuristic Tower-Defense War!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.poster.avif?t=1786660857\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.webm?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.mp4?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the Gameplay?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional Tower-Defense featuring Standard and Special Towers with 4 towers each. Place down towers to shoot at Erossite drones, stop them from reaching the end of the track or you lose health. Earn money by destroying drones, finishing waves, or extracting it. Use money to buy more towers or buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a ability to your advantage. Dig - Destroys all towers and gives money back but at a cost. EMP - Destroys all drones on screen and deals massive damage to bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip flash drives to gain a advantage against Erossite. Collect them by passing Wave 15, 30, and 40, or if you lose you get a flash drive to help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress and unlock more maps, complete a Radar Calibration Puzzle. Scan for matching colors on a radar to fix all the panels. Don't choose the wrong ones or an error occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Permanent Tower Upgrades by leveling up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.poster.avif?t=1786660857\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.webm?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.mp4?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossite is a Futuristic, Postmodernism, Militaristic world. The events of this game take place during 2052 in a world with private militaries, over reaching tech companies, and a overall unstable world. These issues lead to the events of Crossite where Malcolm and Boss fight between their separate ideals on how to fix the world. The two private militaries lead by Malcolm (Crossite) and Boss (Erossite) go to war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malcolm notices how destructive Boss can be and with the help of Sergeant Omri at homebase, they work together to stop Boss. If there is one thing Malcolm and Boss can agree on it they will never use real soldiers or have anyone harmed, instead they use Material Crossite to make towers and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Boss keep to his morals in the conquest of destruction? Will Malcolm break and succumb to Erossite? Play to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Definitive Edition Extra Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission mode - Complete different missions for each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus - Compete against each other in local, or online using Steam Remote Play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode - Select a game mode to compete online, featuring Blitz and more coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Gift - You have to find out on your own!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Private Militaries in a Futuristic Tower-Defense War!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.poster.avif?t=1786660857\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.webm?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/12ac4ea4e034b2222c9f8a62a828ab50.mp4?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the Gameplay?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional Tower-Defense featuring Standard and Special Towers with 4 towers each. Place down towers to shoot at Erossite drones, stop them from reaching the end of the track or you lose health. Earn money by destroying drones, finishing waves, or extracting it. Use money to buy more towers or buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a ability to your advantage. Dig - Destroys all towers and gives money back but at a cost. EMP - Destroys all drones on screen and deals massive damage to bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip flash drives to gain a advantage against Erossite. Collect them by passing Wave 15, 30, and 40, or if you lose you get a flash drive to help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress and unlock more maps, complete a Radar Calibration Puzzle. Scan for matching colors on a radar to fix all the panels. Don't choose the wrong ones or an error occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Permanent Tower Upgrades by leveling up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.poster.avif?t=1786660857\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.webm?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049350/extras/fbea8f58007bfa636024f9640a959316.mp4?t=1786660857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossite is a Futuristic, Postmodernism, Militaristic world. The events of this game take place during 2052 in a world with private militaries, over reaching tech companies, and a overall unstable world. These issues lead to the events of Crossite where Malcolm and Boss fight between their separate ideals on how to fix the world. The two private militaries lead by Malcolm (Crossite) and Boss (Erossite) go to war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malcolm notices how destructive Boss can be and with the help of Sergeant Omri at homebase, they work together to stop Boss. If there is one thing Malcolm and Boss can agree on it they will never use real soldiers or have anyone harmed, instead they use Material Crossite to make towers and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Boss keep to his morals in the conquest of destruction? Will Malcolm break and succumb to Erossite? Play to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Definitive Edition Extra Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission mode - Complete different missions for each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus - Compete against each other in local, or online using Steam Remote Play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode - Select a game mode to compete online, featuring Blitz and more coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Gift - You have to find out on your own!</p>",
